- **APPROVE:** The reviewed response will be sent to the patient.
- **REJECT:** The AI-generated response will not be sent. The patient will receive a polite notification instead.

Please review the response and ensure that it is supported by sufficient evidence before approving it.

Best regards,  
KIDCARE Healthcare Assistant

